AWS Interview Preparation – 1 to 2 Years

If you’re preparing for an AWS role, make sure your core services & basics are crystal clear.

Here are must-prepare AWS interview questions 👇

• What is AWS and why is it used?
• What is EC2 and its use cases?
• Difference between EC2 and Lambda?
• What is an AMI?
• What is Auto Scaling and why do we use it?
• What is Elastic Load Balancer?
• Difference between ALB and NLB?
• What is IAM and why is it important?
Difference between IAM User and IAM Role?
• What is S3 and common use cases?
• Difference between public and private S3 buckets?
• What is VPC?
• Difference between public and private subnet?
• What is a Security Group?
• Difference between Security Group and NACL?
• What is Route 53?
• What is CloudWatch?
• Difference between CloudWatch Logs and Metrics?
• What is an AMI?
• What is RDS?
• Difference between RDS and DynamoDB?
• What is EBS?
Difference between EBS and Instance Store?
• What is AWS Free Tier?
• What AWS services have you used in your project?
